<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Comparación Planes Claude — Don Salazar</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg: #0d0d0f;
    --surface: #16161a;
    --surface2: #1e1e24;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --border2: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    --text: #f0efe8;
    --muted: #888784;
    --hint: #555450;
    --teal: #1D9E75;
    --teal-bg: rgba(29,158,117,0.12);
    --amber: #EF9F27;
    --amber-bg: rgba(239,159,39,0.12);
    --blue: #378ADD;
    --blue-bg: rgba(55,138,221,0.12);
    --red: #E24B4A;
    --red-bg: rgba(226,75,74,0.1);
  }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .page { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }

  header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--teal);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  h1 span { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .context-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .context-card strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 0.5px solid var(--border); }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    min-width: 700px;
  }

  thead tr { background: var(--surface); }

  th {
    padding: 14px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border2);
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  th.feat { text-align: left; width: 26%; }

  .plan-header { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .plan-name { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .plan-price { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .plan-price-sub { font-size: 10px; color: var(--hint); }

  th.recommended { background: rgba(55,138,221,0.06); border-top: 2px solid var(--blue); }

  td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  td.feat {
    text-align: left;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  td.recommended { background: rgba(55,138,221,0.04); }

  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tr:hover td { background: var(--surface); }
  tr:hover td.recommended { background: rgba(55,138,221,0.07); }

  .section-row td {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--hint);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-top: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    background: transparent !important;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .badge-green { background: var(--teal-bg); color: var(--teal); }
  .badge-amber { background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .badge-blue  { background: var(--blue-bg);  color: var(--blue); }
  .badge-red   { background: var(--red-bg);   color: var(--red); }

  .check { color: var(--teal); font-size: 16px; }
  .cross { color: var(--hint); font-size: 16px; }
  .warn  { color: var(--amber); font-size: 12px; }

  .rec-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10px;
    background: var(--blue-bg);
    color: var(--blue);
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(55,138,221,0.3);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--hint);
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .tag { display: inline-block; background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">Análisis · Mayo 2026</p>
    <h1>Planes Claude <span>— contexto Don Salazar</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Comparación entre el plan Pro individual y las opciones de equipo, con el impacto real para cada colaborador.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="context-card">
    <strong>Situación actual:</strong> Eres colaborador en la organización de Don Salazar con tu propio plan Pro ($20/mes individual). Límite semanal actualmente al 100%. Si Don Salazar adquiere un plan de equipo, <strong>pasarías a ser un puesto dentro de ese plan</strong> y dejarías de pagar tu Pro individual.
  </div>

  <div class="table-scroll">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="feat"></th>
        <th>
          <div class="plan-header">
            <span class="plan-name">Tu Pro actual</span>
            <span class="plan-price">$20</span>
            <span class="plan-price-sub">/mes · tú pagas</span>
          </div>
        </th>
        <th>
          <div class="plan-header">
            <span class="plan-name">Team Standard</span>
            <span class="plan-price">$25</span>
            <span class="plan-price-sub">/puesto/mes · Don Salazar</span>
          </div>
        </th>
        <th class="recommended">
          <div class="plan-header">
            <span class="rec-badge">Recomendado</span>
            <span class="plan-name">Team Premium</span>
            <span class="plan-price">$100</span>
            <span class="plan-price-sub">/puesto/mes · Don Salazar</span>
          </div>
        </th>
        <th>
          <div class="plan-header">
            <span class="plan-name">Enterprise</span>
            <span class="plan-price" style="font-size:14px;">A consultar</span>
            <span class="plan-price-sub">asiento + tokens API</span>
          </div>
        </th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>

      <tr class="section-row"><td colspan="5">Costo real</td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">¿Tú pagas algo?</td>
        <td><span class="tag">$20/mes</span></td>
        <td><span class="badge badge-green">Gratis para ti</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="badge badge-green">Gratis para ti</span></td>
        <td><span class="badge badge-green">Gratis para ti</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Costo para Don Salazar (5 puestos mín.)</td>
        <td style="color:var(--hint);">—</td>
        <td>$125/mes<br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint);">$1,200/año</span></td>
        <td class="recommended">$500/mes<br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint);">$6,000/año</span></td>
        <td>Personalizado<br><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint);">+ uso por token</span></td>
      </tr>

      <tr class="section-row"><td colspan="5">Lo que cambia para ti</td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Límite semanal de chat</td>
        <td><span class="warn">⚠ 100% agotado</span></td>
        <td>1.25× Pro</td>
        <td class="recommended"><strong style="color:var(--text);">6.25× Pro</strong></td>
        <td>Sin límite fijo</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Claude Code incluido</td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span> <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint);">no incluido</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Límite Claude Code (acuerdo SpaceX)</td>
        <td>2× ventana 5h</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td class="recommended">2× ventana 5h</td>
        <td>Sin límite fijo</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Sin reducción horas punta</td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span> <span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--hint);">(desde ayer)</span></td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Ventana de contexto</td>
        <td>200K tokens</td>
        <td>200K tokens</td>
        <td class="recommended">200K tokens</td>
        <td><strong style="color:var(--text);">500K tokens</strong></td>
      </tr>

      <tr class="section-row"><td colspan="5">Para la organización</td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Proyectos compartidos</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Slack + Microsoft 365</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Admin + billing central</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">SSO / SCIM / Audit logs</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">HIPAA-ready</td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="cross">✕</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">Sin entrenamiento en tus datos</td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="check">✓</span></td>
        <td><span class="check">✓</span></td>
      </tr>

      <tr class="section-row"><td colspan="5">Veredicto</td></tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="feat">¿Vale la pena?</td>
        <td><span class="badge badge-amber">Límites bajos</span></td>
        <td><span class="badge badge-red">Sin Claude Code</span></td>
        <td class="recommended"><span class="badge badge-green">Mejor opción</span></td>
        <td><span class="badge badge-blue">Si requieren compliance</span></td>
      </tr>

    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Generado con Claude Sonnet 4.6 · Anthropic · Mayo 2026 · github.com/jonelralf/diferencia-de-planes-claude1
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
